{"id":"e7d979873300d8d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-barrelled.md","title":"Barrelled Space","display":"df-barrelled — Barrelled Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-barrelled","aliases":["58-df-barrelled"],"display":"df-barrelled — Barrelled Space","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-barrel.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-barrelled"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-barrelled</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-barrelled — Barrelled Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d2fad00ef7ed0b2\" href=\"?note=9d2fad00ef7ed0b2\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-barrel.md\">../batch06/58-df-barrel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"512a7d4f3a4d640b\" href=\"?note=512a7d4f3a4d640b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md\">../batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\in V\">\\(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> (生成局部凸拓扑的半范数族, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\)</span> (局部凸空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (Hausdorff 空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}\\)</span> (桶谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9d2fad00ef7ed0b2\" href=\"?note=9d2fad00ef7ed0b2\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-barrel.md\">../batch06/58-df-barrel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S\\)</span> (桶化空间谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrelled} \\vdash \\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land \\forall B\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}(B)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_E\\in U\\land U\\subseteq B)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrelled} \\vdash \\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land \\forall B\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}(B)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_E\\in U\\land U\\subseteq B)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every Banach space is barrelled, but this is a theorem rather than a defining clause.</li>\n<li>The neighbourhood conclusion is expanded as an open set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_E\\in U\\subseteq B\">\\(0_E\\in U\\subseteq B\\)</span>; no local neighbourhood-family primitive is assumed.</li>\n<li>In barrelled spaces, pointwise bounded families of continuous linear maps are uniformly bounded.</li>\n<li>Bornological and barrelled are dual notions.</li>\n<li>Montel spaces are reflexive barrelled spaces.</li>\n<li>Barrelled spaces satisfy the Banach–Steinhaus theorem without completeness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-barrel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9d2fad00ef7ed0b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-barrel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md","status":"resolved","id":"512a7d4f3a4d640b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ (生成局部凸拓扑的半范数族, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S$ (局部凸空间谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S$ (Hausdorff 空间谓词, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-barrel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9d2fad00ef7ed0b2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}$ (桶谓词, see [[../batch06/58-df-barrel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrelled} \\vdash \\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land \\forall B\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau}(B)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_E\\in U\\land U\\subseteq B)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"0_E\\in U\\subseteq B","display":false}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"96ccbb39b5f81246","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S$ (typed barrelled-space predicate, see [[58-df-barrelled]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-barrelled.md|58-df-barrelled]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["9d2fad00ef7ed0b2","512a7d4f3a4d640b","7d71608bc30daeda","69f8a4b0afb36176"]}